From d47c3a9789b7cc497d6f148a682b16e63ddb6f4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:56:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] receipts: write the scrubbed path forms as <name> - the
 documents were reintroducing what they documented

The first revision of the phase-3 receipts and the side-findings described the scrub by quoting the exact strings being removed, so carrying them onto the export branch put the user name back 24 times across 4 files - inside the documents proving it was gone. A document about a scrub is inside that scrub's blast radius. Caught only because the sweep was re-run AFTER the documents were carried across.

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - release engineering for this fork; no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED - documents only; no code path is touched.
---
 RELEASE-PREP-PHASE3-RECEIPTS.md | 22 +++++++++++++++-------
 SIDE-FINDINGS-RELEASE-PREP.md   |  2 +-
 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

