 | blob | `c:\Users\MyUsers` | 1 | 1 |
 | **message** | *(any form)* | **0** | — |
@@ -39,10 +39,10 @@ Two findings that shaped the rules:
 `git-filter-repo 2.47.0`, `--replace-text` + `--replace-message` with the same file, `--refs export`:
 
 ```
-literal:<home>==><home>
